<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-31T18:40:50.875Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 18:40:50 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces have stepped up cross-border attacks, striking Saudi airports and oil facilities and launching drones toward Mecca and Medina that Saudi air defenses intercepted, while missiles were also intercepted over Riyadh. Saudi air strikes in Yemen have killed civilians in a residential area and fighting around Taiz has intensified, stressing hospitals. Displacement has risen to 290,000 Yemenis, including pregnant women at risk, as fighting spreads to Aden where missiles have fallen on the airport and presidential palace. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168703&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxOMXVfVkFlUGYya1F1S09GMzdSMnNkaE9nbmkySGFtSkNHcklPRHdQblA5aEN1WDQ5QnVWb2czb3FocHNRalIwWXEzYl9NTzRJYTFUWGQ1NGpIR09EdkllVGd5QmpmZ21pd2dWRVpEczhvT3ZQUGpPaE1vdUpzN29kdzVTVWh1Uld6?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPUnhpZVZHQUliUnJIQUJWb3JmbVl6VV9GZ3NJN0M3X0EzZU9pa2N4SEcybGNlakZkcmxyeVNqV0E5LWRxTU1VZUM4Uk9TdGZTS0RJLU1CZ1JVVFBlM0pTcWFPd2U0b1RFTkVyV2oxSzNwZzYzMjBwVmRtbUFvWUowS1RPSEQ3eE1Qa2ZQQVJ5SExsbzVXQTQtNlZYRC1Bbnh2YmpnZ2VGaHZLQlJDRWJRZEZOU2VCZ1hPcENQcTUtYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxNdjlEdVpUWnZWZVNQY0pHVWFxaU04OEN3NGFfUlFhcGZjc1dBLXh3WFZWTEl5LU5vMXdYR3Y3eDVaVDNaMV8xamdhdXNDUWwwRlZNZjNMakJHekZnUDNfZDROaXlkWjJDT28